  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Agent With Tools\n\nThe basic wiring of an n8n **AI Agent**: one trigger in, one answer out, and three sub-nodes plugged in underneath — a **Chat Model** (the brain), **Simple Memory** (remembers the last turns per `session_id`), and **tools** the agent may call when it decides it needs them: a **Calculator** and a **Wikipedia Search** HTTP Request Tool.\n\n**Credentials needed before running:**\n- OpenAI API key (on the OpenAI Chat Model node)\n\n**How to use:** Import into n8n, add the credential, click *Listen for test event* on the webhook, then:\n`curl -X POST <test-url> -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '{\"message\": \"What is 17% of 2,350, and who founded n8n?\", \"session_id\": \"demo\"}'`\nThe answer comes back in the curl response.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-agent",
      "name": "Chat Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ai-agent-tools",
        "options": {},
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-agent",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.message }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a helpful assistant. Use the Calculator for any arithmetic and Wikipedia Search for facts you are not sure about. Say which tools you used."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chat-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        120,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        280,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Chat Request').item.json.body.session_id || 'default-session' }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculator",
      "name": "Calculator",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolCalculator",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "wikipedia",
      "name": "Wikipedia Search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequestTool",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "action",
              "value": "query"
            },
            {
              "name": "list",
              "value": "search"
            },
            {
              "name": "srsearch",
              "value": "={{ $fromAI('search_term', 'The topic to look up on Wikipedia, in a few words', 'string') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "value": "json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "toolDescription": "Searches Wikipedia for background information on a topic."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "respond",
      "name": "Send Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        560,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { answer: $json.output } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
